Cyberpunk style: A solitary figure sits in lotus meditation pose atop a towering bamboo stalk that bends gracefully in a neon-soaked storm, surrounded by a chaotic cityscape of fractured holographic data streams and glitching skyscrapers. The figure emanates five concentric rings of energy in gradient colors—deep violet at the core expanding through indigo, teal, amber, to electric pink at the outer edge. Rain falls in diagonal sheets, each droplet reflecting the city's chromatic chaos, while the bamboo remains flexible, unbroken. The figure's silhouette shows neural pathways glowing beneath translucent skin, suggesting inner calm amid external turbulence. Multiple ghostly perspective lines radiate outward from the figure's eyes, representing different viewpoints converging. The sky churns with pixelated clouds and lightning rendered in vaporwave gradients. At street level far below, crowds move as blurred streaks of motion, disconnected from the centered stillness above.
